WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.203
Pip and the Little Bridge.

00:00:03.483 --> 00:00:08.351
This is Pip. Today, he is building a bridge.

00:00:08.631 --> 00:00:11.292
A bridge for his little toy duck.

00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:15.330
Ready, Ducky? Let's go!

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:19.064
One block. Two blocks.

00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:22.201
Wobble, wobble... crash!

00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:25.882
Oh no! My bridge!

00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:30.690
Pip tries again. But the blocks fall down.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:33.011
I can't do it.

00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:35.654
His friend Bo comes over.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.892
Do you need some help?

00:00:38.172 --> 00:00:42.320
Yes, please. Can you help me?

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:49.170
Your turn! Say: Can you help me?

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:53.561
Of course! Let's try together.

00:00:53.841 --> 00:00:56.200
Big blocks at the bottom.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.901
A long block on top.

00:00:59.181 --> 00:01:03.596
You hold this side. I'll hold that side.

00:01:03.876 --> 00:01:08.518
Ready? One, two, three!

00:01:08.798 --> 00:01:13.476
The bridge is ready. Pip gives it a gentle tap.

00:01:13.756 --> 00:01:15.975
It's not wobbly!

00:01:16.255 --> 00:01:19.072
Now, the little duck can cross.

00:01:19.352 --> 00:01:23.278
Roll, roll, roll... all the way across!

00:01:23.558 --> 00:01:24.833
We did it!

00:01:25.113 --> 00:01:27.197
We did it together!

00:01:27.477 --> 00:01:32.269
Pip smiles. Asking for help was a good idea.

00:01:32.549 --> 00:01:34.344
Thank you, Bo.

00:01:34.624 --> 00:01:36.832
You're welcome, Pip.

00:01:37.112 --> 00:01:43.584
Now you try! Let's try together.

00:01:43.864 --> 00:01:49.266
One more! We did it!

00:01:49.546 --> 00:01:54.165
What will you build with a friend?

00:01:54.445 --> 00:01:59.505
A little bridge. A big team.

